Licence structure
-----------------

This firmware is a derivative work of HaleHound-CYD:

  Upstream           HaleHound-CYD, https://github.com/JesseCHale/HaleHound-CYD
  Upstream author    Jesse C. Hale (JesseCHale), building on ESP32-DIV by
                     CiferTech
  Forked from        upstream commit 68bbfe6, 2026-03-16 -- taken while the
                     upstream was still distributed under the MIT licence
  Modified by        RockBase-iot, from commit c9d7598, 2026-07-27 onward

The upstream's MIT grant, exactly as received, is preserved verbatim in
LICENSES/HaleHound-CYD-MIT.txt.  The upstream later replaced its licence with a
proprietary text, somewhere between its v3.5.0 and v3.6.2 releases; that does
not affect the grant already made for the code this fork is based on, and this
project does not use material published under the later terms.

Third-party libraries are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md with their licences,
and every licence text is collected in LICENSES/.  Read those two alongside this
file: this project's own licence says nothing about the components it links.

