------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This firmware is built against libraries that carry their own terms, including
copyleft terms.  As of 2026-10-16 the dependency set cannot lawfully be
redistributed as a compiled binary: one dependency is GPL-2.0-only, another is
GPL-3.0, and those two are mutually incompatible, while a third grants no
licence at all.  The audit, the evidence and the plan to resolve it are in
docs/legal/COMPLIANCE_PLAN_zh.md.

This section exists so that the current state of the tree is not mistaken for a
distributable release.  Do not redistribute a binary built from it until the
blockers in that plan are closed.

