------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  RESPONSIBLE USE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This firmware is a wireless security toolkit.  Several of its functions transmit
and several disrupt other people's traffic.  Use it only on equipment you own or
have written authorisation to test, and only where the local radio regulations
allow it.  Jamming and unauthorised interception are criminal offences in most
jurisdictions.  See NOTICE.md.
